          "content": "Great question! Let me explain **Internal Notes** and why they're critical for professional hiring:\n\n## 📝 What are Internal Notes?\n\n**Location**: Right sidebar of the application detail page (only visible to employer/hiring team)\n\n**Purpose**: Private comments about candidates that help teams collaborate on hiring decisions.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Why You Need Internal Notes\n\n### **Real-World Hiring Scenario**:\n\n```\nYour Company has 3 people involved in hiring:\n├─ Sarah (HR Manager) - Reviews applications first\n├─ Mike (Technical Lead) - Does technical interviews\n└─ You (CEO) - Makes final decision\n```\n\n**Without Internal Notes:**\n- Sarah reviews 50 applications\n- She has to remember which ones were good\n- Mike interviews candidates but doesn't know Sarah's thoughts\n- You make final decision without context\n- **Result**: Miscommunication, missed great candidates\n\n**With Internal Notes:**\n```\nApplication for \"John Doe - Senior Developer\"\n\nInternal Notes (Private - Only your team sees):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Jan 15, 2026 - Sarah (HR):                      │\n│ \"Strong resume, 5 years React experience.       │\n│  Salary expectation: 200K. Schedule technical   │\n│  interview with Mike.\"                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Jan 18, 2026 - Mike (Tech Lead):                │\n│ \"Excellent technical interview! Solved all      │\n│  coding challenges. Great culture fit.          │\n│  Recommend moving to final round.\"              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Jan 20, 2026 - You (CEO):                       │\n│ \"Approved! Send offer at 180K.\"                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 💼 How Big Companies Use This\n\n### **LinkedIn/Indeed/Fuzu Pattern**:\n\n1. **Screening Notes**:\n   - \"Resume looks good but missing AWS experience\"\n   - \"Overqualified for this role, consider for senior position\"\n\n2. **Interview Feedback**:\n   - \"Technical skills: 8/10\"\n   - \"Communication: 9/10\"\n   - \"Red flag: Left last 3 jobs within 6 months\"\n\n3. **Salary Negotiations**:\n   - \"Candidate expects 250K, our budget is 200K\"\n   - \"Willing to negotiate on remote work\"\n\n4. **Reference Checks**:\n   - \"Called previous employer - positive feedback\"\n   - \"LinkedIn profile verified\"\n\n5. **Team Consensus**:\n   - \"3 out of 4 interviewers recommend hire\"\n   - \"Waiting for final approval from CTO\"\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Benefits for Your Platform\n\n1. **Better Hiring Decisions**\n   - All context in one place\n   - No information lost in emails/Slack\n\n2. **Faster Process**\n   - Next person knows what happened\n   - No need to re-evaluate from scratch\n\n3. **Audit Trail**\n   - Who said what and when\n   - Protects against discrimination claims\n\n4. **Team Collaboration**\n   - @mention team members\n   - Everyone stays aligned\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 How It Looks (Right Sidebar)\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 📝 INTERNAL NOTES (Private)        │\n│ ──────────────────────────────────│\n│ [+ Add Note]                       │\n│                                    │\n│ ┌────────────────────────────────┐│\n│ │ Jan 18 - Sarah:                ││\n│ │ \"Strong candidate, schedule    ││\n│ │  technical interview\"          ││\n│ │                                ││\n│ │ [Edit] [Delete]                ││\n│ └────────────────────────────────┘│\n│                                    │\n│ ┌────────────────────────────────┐│\n│ │ Jan 16 - Mike:                 ││\n│ │ \"Resume looks good, but check  ││\n│ │  AWS experience\"               ││\n│ │                                ││\n│ │ [Edit] [Delete]                ││\n│ └────────────────────────────────┘│\n└────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Important: Candidate NEVER Sees These\n\n- Notes are **100% private**\n- Only your hiring team sees them\n- Candidate only sees their application status\n\n---\n\n**Should I implement the full notes system with:**\n- Add/edit/delete notes\n- Timestamp + author name\n- Note history\n\nOr keep it simple for MVP (just add notes, no edit/delete)?"
